SrI7ShnX18WQfSC4hgfrqPSTsavfaQokEudyWJ5zK8BA&oe=6AF334C4"}, {"file_name": "5.png", "id": "467916352871409", "uri": "https://scontent-sea5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/39003282_467916356204742_1871921057092171900_n.png?_nc_cat=105&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=RcI6rS3fj4kQ7kNvwF_fZcS&_nc_oc=Adp0kAzxa69EMhJaDdl8qFDwhdI2NFODLg6ly-PKrN-hPpSFtQvKFyfRFb3M137uy4w&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sea5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQSLKRLCayJghX1vaV37ZMlTwVYTdEId84TwneD5BA3Jfw&oe=6AF351A2"}, {"file_name": "3.png", "id": "1934382610375855", "uri": "https://scontent-sea5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38974473_1934382613709188_7156337812617042679_n.png?_nc_cat=100&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=pPP-NlkeVqIQ7kNvwHmynC9&_nc_oc=AdoJ8sK-uBmLzaEvxvVv-LkfhKORE8TJXXvkjpV3qswE7SNFLsgU-tXBVFLusCgBIcc&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sea5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQQo-uhXIRR9bW1WFb06xKfByT-k--TxO39UshX-EVOzlw&oe=6AF33BB3"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "landscape.png", "id": "1524760081483769", "uri": "https://scontent-sea5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38974531_1524760084817102_6497712644828891067_n.png?_nc_cat=100&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=Cj6izO9pyxcQ7kNvwG_FqcT&_nc_oc=AdpiPXuMIxaN1W-BkYlDtQmvW75IUkfp20Mpy9DYotWlySRrDJiXDsyiHdaQXigGEYo&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sea5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQS9Oxv6e6Y2-xPPZihJ8nWz6kZhJcQZSWPAw5ANGRboYQ&oe=6AF33AAF"}, "display_name": "Mystery Box VR: Hidden Secrets", "keywords": [], "long_description": " AN IMMERSIVE VR PUZZLE EXPERIENCE\nInteract with objects, handles, buttons, and wheels on each side. Crack enigmas and collect hidden puzzle tiles on a random side of the boxes.\n\nYou won't be able to compare reality with fiction.\n\n# DISCOVER INVENTIONS\nOnce you unlock all 8 boxes of a Level Pack, you can compose a puzzle and discover a brief history of an invention.\n\nIt's not always easy to escape the room, so use all your IQ to crack the riddles. There's a logic behind all of them, even where it seems it's not!\n\n# IMMERSIVE SOUNDTRACK\nPlay the game with your headphones to get immersed in this amazing adventure.\n\n# HINTS\nGot stuck on some enigma? No worries, you can still get a helpful hint! You can also get in touch with me in case you really can't make it through a riddle, I'll be glad to help ;)\n\n# MULTILANGUAGE\nAvailable in English, French, Italian, German, Spanish, Russian, and Japanese.\n\nThe game language will change automatically based on the language settings of your device", "short_description": "A VR escape room game where you have to solve intriguing riddles to open boxes and discover nice stories about popular inventions!"}, {"images": {"nodes": [{"file_name": "$R36BSY5.png", "id": "3678762505771822", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_PORTRAIT", "uri": "https://scontent-sea5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/39031430_3678762509105155_2151975047074617165_n.png?_nc_cat=102&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=L35lklFUzGwQ7kNvwFssHJ1&_nc_oc=Adok5BU0sVcnln2190xNZyvpjRXFXFCKTs0HtqiAIFHKE8ZzcKna-BdintQZv2MisTQ&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sea5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQSbQcnUeJv6i1CEpU_xl3zPQLvTDTwFaUnYtLy38-ZhGQ&oe=6AF336A5"}, {"file_name": "$R81V725.png", "id": "2720695481426567", "image_type": "APP_IMG_ICON", "uri": "https://scontent-sea5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/75262743_2720695484759900_604086922326600035_n.png?_nc_cat=108&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=XGZJhtiZoFMQ7kNvwHtfJfi&_nc_oc=AdqZYBvy18-vrq6hNkZWW7bU-WU_8vVXyLFOwQehLgEzn5kjrUREYs7J8l022_qzggY&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sea5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQQjs80hVzuuQSIDcMZC4eHCpU7rZQfeAm95DqR-Ah98Pw&oe=6AF3358D"}, {"file_name": "$RQ3SN6U.png", "id": "1552311425628973", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_LANDSCAPE", "uri": "https://scontent-sea5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38982519_1552311428962306_1218130395049083834_n.png?_nc_cat=111&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=ivuJwpZbrHAQ7kNvwFjAS2A&_nc_oc=Adr1yVJV07KSSI5aWn4jr0kio9lXlvxA_ZEz8R9yq8puzME4q6pOGNnxwjMlOCeraKA&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=